:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:52a247272a91853f81b81ca8f345213710b88fb3a15c6c0b2c137fec1da183d0","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-23T01:40:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T01:40:26Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.88.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.88.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.88.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.88.0 — Same-page chapter download recovery\n\nChapter download errors now tell players to retry from the current page using the existing chapter download control. The prior message unnecessarily told players to reload the whole page. Fetch, abort, diagnostics, validation, installation, storage and chapter ownership behavior are unchanged.\n\nThis release does not claim to fix the separate PNG/JPEG mission-selection issue.\n\nSource: `950f19045facacf5151c90661de1ca28d30658df` (tree `0c288a694a4c2cba04a7ae331eb3a376bdd4c811`), merged through [PR #284](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/284).\n\nThe exact-head [PR checks](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35805147386) passed preflight and the ordinary production build. The actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35805888288) passed source identity, validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, motion syntax, production reproduction/readiness and the immutable freeze. Automated suites were explicitly waived under the temporary reviewed policy; no passing full-suite verdict is claimed.\n\nThe guarded read-only [artifact inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35806541051) verified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution manifest byte and hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory. The PR head and merged source have the same tree.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,074,583 bytes, SHA-256 `8d7cc857a2eb2d31432b27220d31b6a1ed33990fb6158de1e8c3fdf5d756706f`.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,619,701,760 bytes, SHA-256 `83cab59895dcd692cc378d44051c0a6d255f799cecb761ad7528fc70d00d7d98`.\n\nPages selection, predecessor preservation, public byte verification and bounded browser checks remain separate acceptance gates until the selector PR is merged and the deployed site is checked. Physical controllers, physical touch, cold-offline use, full campaign balance, the PNG/JPEG issue and musical/listening acceptance are not claimed by this release package.\n"}